WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.234 --> 00:00:02.969
-We're hanging out
with Jeremy Renner!

00:00:02.969 --> 00:00:04.937
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:04.937 --> 00:00:09.342
His new show "Hawkeye" debuts on
Disney Plus this Wednesday.

00:00:09.342 --> 00:00:11.010
-Yes.

00:00:11.010 --> 00:00:14.680
-I got to see a snippet of it,
because it's Marvel

00:00:14.680 --> 00:00:17.050
and they are very -- they don't
really let people see much.

00:00:17.050 --> 00:00:19.252
-Right.
-In my snippet, was another

00:00:19.252 --> 00:00:22.288
smaller snippet
of "a Captain America" musical.

00:00:22.288 --> 00:00:24.423
-Uh-huh.

00:00:24.423 --> 00:00:26.925
-Could there be an actual
"Avengers" musical

00:00:26.925 --> 00:00:29.061
in the works on Broadway?

00:00:29.061 --> 00:00:31.063
Well, I...
[ Laughter ]

00:00:31.063 --> 00:00:32.932
Well, I'm not sure about that.

00:00:32.932 --> 00:00:35.869
Look, it was actually the last
scene that we shot in the show.

00:00:35.869 --> 00:00:38.738
Actually, you got to see it.

00:00:38.738 --> 00:00:40.339
It's quite a show.
-It's really good.

00:00:40.339 --> 00:00:43.609
-It's actually pretty
danged good.

00:00:43.609 --> 00:00:46.880
Kevin's mind is really
turning on this.

00:00:46.880 --> 00:00:48.614
He's the head of Marvel.
-Yeah.

00:00:48.614 --> 00:00:50.783
-And I have no idea what he's
going to do with it.

00:00:50.783 --> 00:00:55.021
There's a lot more of the show
that's in the "Hawkeye" show,

00:00:55.021 --> 00:00:57.656
but who knows, I don't know.

00:00:57.656 --> 00:00:59.359
I'm not a soothsayer.

00:00:59.359 --> 00:01:03.529
-No, but what I saw
was pretty good.

00:01:03.529 --> 00:01:06.666
Did you do -- do you know if
there's more than one song?

00:01:06.666 --> 00:01:08.368
-I think there are.

00:01:08.368 --> 00:01:09.969
[ Laughter ]

00:01:09.969 --> 00:01:12.138
-Okay. I don't want to get you
in trouble, but alright.

00:01:12.138 --> 00:01:13.273
I like that answer.

00:01:13.273 --> 00:01:14.641
[ Laughter ]

00:01:14.641 --> 00:01:16.041
Can I ask you about some rumors?

00:01:16.041 --> 00:01:17.977
-Sure, what do you got?
Okay.

00:01:17.977 --> 00:01:19.279
-I got some answers for you.

00:01:19.279 --> 00:01:22.114
-Okay, Yelena --

00:01:22.114 --> 00:01:24.751
Florence Pugh
from "Black Widow."

00:01:24.751 --> 00:01:26.052
-Who?

00:01:26.052 --> 00:01:28.121
[ Laughter ]

00:01:28.121 --> 00:01:29.522
Who's that?
-Yelena.

00:01:29.522 --> 00:01:30.623
-Yeah, I don't know.

00:01:30.623 --> 00:01:32.959
[ Laughter ]

00:01:32.959 --> 00:01:34.293
-You don't?
-I'm not sure.

00:01:34.293 --> 00:01:35.828
-Yeah?
-It doesn't sound familiar.

00:01:35.828 --> 00:01:37.396
-Yeah, she knows you.

00:01:37.396 --> 00:01:38.764
-Is that right?

00:01:38.764 --> 00:01:40.767
-I'm just wondering if she --

00:01:40.767 --> 00:01:43.068
-Are you talking about thing at
the end of "Black Widow."

00:01:43.068 --> 00:01:44.737
-Yeah.
-Yeah, yeah.

00:01:44.737 --> 00:01:47.607
I watched that with my niece,
and she's like,

00:01:47.607 --> 00:01:50.075
"Oh, Uncle Jeremy,
what did you do?"

00:01:50.075 --> 00:01:51.911
-Okay.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:51.911 --> 00:01:53.379
-I said, "I didn't do
anything darling."

00:01:53.379 --> 00:01:54.413
-Oh, okay.

00:01:54.413 --> 00:01:55.381
-And that's all I know
about that.

00:01:55.381 --> 00:01:57.917
-Okay.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:57.917 --> 00:01:59.452
Okay.

00:01:59.452 --> 00:02:01.553
[ Laughs ]
How about this?

00:02:01.553 --> 00:02:03.089
After this show...
-Yeah?

00:02:03.089 --> 00:02:05.758
-...will we see you play
Hawkeye again?

00:02:05.758 --> 00:02:06.993
-Who?

00:02:06.993 --> 00:02:08.995
[ Laughter ]

00:02:10.563 --> 00:02:11.698
-Yelena.
-Sounds familiar.

00:02:11.698 --> 00:02:13.332
[ Laughter ]

00:02:13.332 --> 00:02:15.802
-Yeah, okay. Perfect.
I don't want to --

00:02:15.802 --> 00:02:18.003
What can we tell everyone
"Hawkeye" is about?

00:02:18.003 --> 00:02:21.373
-Hawkeye, well, what I love
about it, first of all,

00:02:21.373 --> 00:02:24.143
we got to kind of introduce
the world

00:02:24.143 --> 00:02:26.712
to Clint Barton in a bigger way
because there's six hours.

00:02:26.712 --> 00:02:29.582
We can spend a lot more time
on just the characters

00:02:29.582 --> 00:02:30.750
and the new characters
introduced.

00:02:30.750 --> 00:02:34.086
But it's also in a world
of this world, right?

00:02:34.086 --> 00:02:36.055
It's not in a galactic with the
aliens and all these things.

00:02:36.055 --> 00:02:38.157
It's in a really practical world

00:02:38.157 --> 00:02:40.326
like a superhero
with no superpowers.

00:02:40.326 --> 00:02:41.494
-I want to show everyone a clip.

00:02:41.494 --> 00:02:43.362
Here's Jeremy Renner
in "Hawkeye."

00:02:43.362 --> 00:02:44.931
Take a look at this.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:47.466 --> 00:02:49.869
-[ Indistinct shouting ]

00:02:49.869 --> 00:02:51.670
-Come on.

00:02:51.670 --> 00:02:52.872
-Ah.

00:02:52.872 --> 00:02:54.206
[ Cheering ]

00:02:54.206 --> 00:02:58.444
♪♪

00:02:58.444 --> 00:03:01.047
Whoa, whoa!
Put him at!

00:03:01.047 --> 00:03:02.581
[ Whooshes ]

00:03:02.581 --> 00:03:03.983
What are you doing?

00:03:03.983 --> 00:03:05.385
-Put him out! Here's on fire!

00:03:06.785 --> 00:03:08.087
-Told you.

00:03:08.087 --> 00:03:09.121
-Yeah.

00:03:09.121 --> 00:03:13.225
♪♪

00:03:13.225 --> 00:03:14.460
Got to get that suit.

00:03:14.460 --> 00:03:21.400
♪♪

00:03:21.400 --> 00:03:25.671
♪♪

00:03:25.671 --> 00:03:27.473
Come on!

00:03:27.473 --> 00:03:28.407
That's all you've got?!

00:03:28.407 --> 00:03:30.209
Come on!
Throw another one!

00:03:30.209 --> 00:03:32.277
-Yeah, exactly.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:32.277 --> 00:03:33.579
Jeremy Renner, everybody!

00:03:33.579 --> 00:03:36.549
"Hawkeye" premieres Wednesday
on Disney Plus.

